      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have a general Skia style question: do we prefer that clients not use public getters on the object itself? What is the reason for preferring `SkRuntimeEffectPriv::Hash(effect)` instead of `effect.hash()` or `SkRuntimeEffectPriv::Program(effect)` instead of something like `effect.baseProgram()` ?",
